# Original edap/ofxLSystem example grammars (MIT):
# OFX | <settings>
# OFX | <treed>
# OFX | <rule>
# OFX | X -&gt; F[+X]F[-X]+X;
# OFX | F -&gt; FF;
# OFX | </rule>
# OFX | <axiom>X</axiom>
# OFX | <maxDepth>7</maxDepth>
# OFX | <theta>20</theta>
# OFX | <bg_color>39, 128, 123, 255</bg_color>
